From: Qt upstream, commit 1c6fb56a9686ad012b35ecbee9a67cc6686b6099
Subject: Pipewire: Fix heap-use-after-free in CoreEventListener destructor

Backport of https://github.com/qt/qtmultimedia/commit/1c6fb56a9686ad012b35ecbee9a67cc6686b6099
Copyright (C) 2025 The Qt Company Ltd.
SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-Qt-Commercial OR LGPL-3.0-only OR GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only

Synchronize hook removal with PipeWire event-loop dispatch. Keep the native
Qt 6.10.2 ABI and system style plugins; do not replace the audio backend.

--- a/src/multimedia/pipewire/qpipewire_async_support.cpp
+++ b/src/multimedia/pipewire/qpipewire_async_support.cpp
@@ -84,3 +84,5 @@ CoreEventListener::~CoreEventListener()
 {
-    removeHooks();
+    QAudioContextManager::withEventLoopLock([&] {
+        removeHooks();
+    });
 }
